# pop'n music 9 (Konami Python 1): key-to-picture latency in emulated frames. Test mode,
# I/O CHECK > INPUT CHECK, where the screen only changes when a switch does; button 1 is
# pressed for 10 frames every 60. tools/pylatency.py reads the run's --digest: the frames
# from each press (and release) to the first changed picture.
game popn9

at 3200 press "Test" 8
at 3400 press "P1 Button 5" 10     # I/O CHECK
at 3500 press "P1 Button 5" 10     # INPUT CHECK
from 3700 every 60 press "P1 Button 1" 10
at 5000 quit
